     "_fork_prefix_snapshot": None,
+    # Fork snapshot (tools/delegate_tool_fork.ForkContext), installed by
+    # _install_fork_context_surface at the end of construction; None on
+    # parents and non-fork children. ``AIAgent._is_fork_child`` (read-only)
+    # is ``fork_context is not None``.
